CHAPTER.VERS:
But after thy hardness and impenitent heart 

          While you are giving yourself to pleasures, thinking to increase your goods, you will find God's wrath.
         treasurest up unto thyself wrath against the day of wrath and revelation of the righteous judgment of God;

And knowest [his] will, and 

          Can test and discern what things swerve from God's will.
         approvest the things that are more excellent, being instructed out of the law;
